      "body": "## Motivation\n\nFixes #45155. Shared prefix pages are deduplicated, but the per-rank gather block still sums each request's prefix bound, so padding is copied and communicated at every layer.\n\n## Modifications\n\nCap the existing bound with `ceil(Kmax / N) + U - Kmax`, where `U` is the unique prefix-page count and `Kmax` the longest prefix. The remaining unique pages are conservatively allowed to belong to one rank. This reuses existing metadata without another host synchronization or collective. Add shared/nested-prefix, skewed-owner and multi-GPU regression coverage.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\n- `test_page_interleave_shard.py`: 78 passed, 415 subtests passed; four-GPU case skipped on the two-GPU host.\n- 24,600 greedy first-token outputs match baseline; 820 sampled output/top-10 logprob checks match exactly across page sizes 4/16/32/64/128.\n- Ruff lint/format, isort and `git diff --check` pass.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nQwen3-32B BF16, 2×H100, TP2/CP2, FA3, YaRN 4×, eight requests sharing a cached prefix and adding 128 input tokens each. Base: `7c99ace127`. Per page size: ABBA server runs, 15 warmup + 30 timed batches per case/run. Metric: median batch maximum of server `e2e_latency`.\n\n| Page size | 32K latency reduction | 64K | 120K |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| 4 | 15.2% | 21.9% | 27.7% |\n| 16 | 15.8% | 22.2% | 27.8% |\n| 32 | 15.7% | 22.1% | 27.7% |\n| 64 | 16.0% | 22.8% | 28.0% |\n| 128 | 19.4% | 27.9% | 31.9% |\n\nAt page 64, 120K improves from 1,020 to 734 ms. Single-request/unshared-prefix control medians change by at most 1.3%; isolated tail spikes remain.\n\nThese are synthetic cached-prefix prefill measurements with real weights/NCCL, fake P/D transfer and an identical benchmark-only cache-insertion hook on both variants. They do not measure decode or full P/D performance.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39241942948](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39241942948)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39241943223](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39241943223)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39241943031](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39241943031)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
